{
  "$comment": "Golden cases for the /find reader (pnpm agent:eval). `expect` holds fields that must match: a value, {between:[lo,hi]}, {near:'<name>'}, {has:[...]} for arrays, or {placed:true}. `absent` lists fields that must stay unset. `clear`, `intent`, `like`, `notLike`, `remember` (min count) and `forget` check the rest of the reading. Today is 2026-10-21 in every case. `rulesOnly: true` scores a case on the rules reader alone (a behaviour only the rules have yet, e.g. a bare \"near a school\").",
